{"v":1,"why":"CARD-ENG2-UPD (jumpr 3591): the newest LIVE store build of each store, read by the game's update note (sec:CARD-ENG2-UPD in index.html) beside the page. JSON in a .webmanifest file because the pack carries the root's .webmanifest files and no root .json (shell/ios/bundle_game.sh MEDIA); nothing links it, it is not a web app manifest. ios = the App Store, play = Google Play, amazon = the Amazon Appstore (a store with no live build is left out). build = that store build's own number (iPhone CFBundleVersion, Android versionCode), compared with the app's; store = its version as the store shows it (for people); min = the lowest build that may still play (0 = no gate). Kept in step with shell/pack/FLOORS.json: when a store build goes live, its line here moves in the same commit. Format: design/eng2-update-note-1116/00-CARD-ENG2-UPD.md section 4.","ios":{"store":"1.0.16","build":28,"min":0},"play":{"store":"1.0.11","build":10,"min":0}}
